+# 04: Confirm a reservation into an order
+
+**What to build:** Once payment succeeds, the payment service confirms an active reservation and gets back a normal placed Order covering exactly the reserved units. The reserved units become the order's allocation, so available stock does not change. The payment service retries confirm, so confirming an already confirmed reservation returns the same order and creates nothing. Confirming too late is reported as expired. See the spec (`spec.md` in this feature directory).
+
+**Blocked by:** 03 (Reservations expire on their own)
+
+**Status:** resolved
