+
+**What to build:** When a customer abandons checkout, the cart service releases the reservation and its units become available immediately instead of after 20 minutes. Late or repeated release calls are harmless no-ops; stock belonging to a paid order cannot be given back. This completes the reservation lifecycle, so the README is updated to describe it. See the spec (`spec.md` in this feature directory) and the glossary.
