+- [x] Releasing an `EXPIRED` reservation returns it unchanged (still `EXPIRED`), without error
+- [x] Releasing a `CONFIRMED` reservation raises `InvalidReservationState` and leaves it and its order untouched
+- [x] Confirming a `RELEASED` reservation raises `InvalidReservationState`
